"Puhta ja minimalistliku kujundusega termokviitung kitsale 58 mm paberile. Sama paigutus kui 80 mm variandil, kohandatud 32 märgi laiusele."

#. translators: Gallery template name shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:563
msgid "Simple Thermal Receipt (80mm)"
msgstr "Lihtne termokviitung (80 mm)"

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:565
msgid ""
"Clean, minimal thermal receipt for standard 80mm paper. Store header, line items, totals, and barcode."
msgstr ""
"Puhta ja minimalistliku kujundusega termokviitung standardsele 80 mm paberile. Poe päis, kaubaread, kogusummad ja vöötkood."

#. translators: Gallery template name shown in the admin Template Gallery. The (RTL) suffix marks right-to-left layout.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:576
msgid "Simple Thermal Receipt 80mm (RTL)"
msgstr "Lihtne termokviitung 80 mm (RTL)"

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery. CP864 / Windows-1256 are printer codepages; keep them verbatim.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:578
msgid ""
"Right-to-left thermal receipt for 80mm printers. Mirrors column alignments for Arabic, Hebrew, Persian and Urdu. Requires a printer that supports an Arabic codepage (CP864 or Windows-1256) — check your printer's manual before ordering."
msgstr ""
"Paremalt vasakule termokviitung 80 mm printeritele. Peegeldab veergude joondust araabia, heebrea, pärsia ja urdu jaoks. Vajab printerit, mis toetab araabia koodilehte (CP864 või Windows-1256) — kontrolli enne tellimist printeri kasutusjuhendit."

#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:590
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:601
msgid "A tabular report with groups, subtotals and totals."
msgstr "Tabelaruanne rühmade, vahesummade ja kogusummadega."

#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:600
